# The cape and lan-sim images are built from the repo root (the first copies cape/ and guest/, the second
# lan-sim/ and one file of cape/); nothing else belongs in their build context, and data/ alone is
# several GB of ISOs.
*
!cape
!guest
!lan-sim
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
cape/tests
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
lan-sim/tests
lan-sim/.venv
cape/.venv
